<title>USA: GRC International sells unit to Instron.</title>
<headline>GRC International sells unit to Instron.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRC International Inc said on Tuesday that has sold its Dynatup materials testing business unit, which was formerly known as GRC Instruments, to Instron Corp for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Dynatup designs, manufactures and distributes destructive and non- destructive materials testing products and services, the company said.</p>
